	url = {https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/105029084396?origin=resultslist},
	abstract = {This project addresses the complexity and frequent misunderstandings associated with Islamic inheritance, or Faraid, which requires a combination of religious and mathematical expertise. Traditional approaches such as manual calculation, consultation with experts, or reliance on rigid software systems often result in inefficiency, inaccuracy, and inaccessibility for users without specialized knowledge. To overcome these challenges, an intelligent and user-friendly chatbot was developed using Dialogflow CX, incorporating Natural Language Understanding in the Malay language to facilitate more natural and intuitive interactions. A rule-based engine, developed in Python, automates the inheritance calculations with high accuracy and in full compliance with established Islamic legal principles. User data and calculation outputs are securely stored in Google BigQuery, ensuring efficient data management and retrieval. Additionally, Google Looker Studio is used to generate clear and interactive visualizations such as pie charts and bar graphs, helping users better understand inheritance distributions. This integrated system significantly enhances user experience by reducing errors, simplifying complex legal computations, and promoting fair and transparent wealth allocation. The chatbot enables individuals of various backgrounds, regardless of technical or legal proficiency, to access accurate and personalized inheritance information in an engaging and understandable format. Potential improvements include extending the chatbot's capabilities to handle more intricate inheritance scenarios, incorporating advanced machine learning techniques to enhance interaction and prediction accuracy, and implementing secure user authentication features to enable more customized and protected sessions.  © COPYRIGHT SPIE. Downloading of the abstract is permitted for personal use only.},
