	abstract = {The development and implementation of a dental care chatbot aimed at providing personalized oral health information and solutions. The chatbot leverages the capabilities of Rasa AI tool for natural language understanding and dialogue management. The system begins by gathering essential user information such as name, age, gender, and contact details. Subsequently, users can engage in interactive conversations with the chatbot, addressing their dental health queries and concerns. The chatbot offers tailored tips and solutions based on the user's input and existing dental knowledge. This paper showcases the design, architecture, and functionality of the chatbot, highlighting its potential to enhance dental care accessibility and education in an innovative and user-friendly manner. © 2024 IEEE.},
